# ============================================
# MyLibrarySystem — Whitelist-mode .gitignore
# Root README, docs, library-frontend, and library-server are tracked.
# Everything else at the repo root is ignored.
# ============================================

# --- Ignore everything at repo root ---
*
/*

# --- Allow only these directories and this file ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!library-frontend/
!library-server/
